
Usage: gitpak <command> [flag]

A package manager for ensuring software from git stays up to date

Flags:
    --help, -h          Show help info
    --version, -v       Print the version info

Commands:
    install ,in <url>   Install a package by the git URL
    remove, rm <name>   Remove a package from gitpak (Does not uninstall package!!!)
    update, up          Update installed packages
    list-updates, lu    List packages which need updating
    list                List installed packages
    force-install, fi   Installs the package regarless of whether it needs updating